{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d0d69a0428c13b8f442311cc3a109498043c4f083b5ff1a73750fc209eb8fb20", "ja": "（今日は、初公演を無事に終えた未来と、\n今後の活動について打ち合わせをするのだが……）", "zh": "（今天要和顺利结束首次公演的未来商量今后的活动安排，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "e1bf783458cf76b78a9f950a0fe7eb7d195ed09fdfe0dba4369ddbe66927d5e5", "ja": "『打ち合わせ』って、なんだか大人って感じですよね。\nよーしっ。私もキリッと打ち合わせします！", "zh": "“商谈”这个词，总觉得很有大人的感觉呢。\n好——！我也要一本正经地商谈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1002_p", "source_sha256": "020305048bf4792a75fa726f685698ec0041b7b9507abcb8ca9bbc516296a275", "ja": "そんな構えなくて大丈夫だよ。リラックスして\nお茶とかしながら、のんびり話そうか。", "zh": "不用那么紧张，放轻松点。\n我们可以一边喝茶什么的，一边悠闲地聊聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "c6d922f44384efa88b170bd973718548480cb451dd5a0bbd79905a6e20aae358", "ja": "あ、そうなんですか？　じゃあ……\nもしかして、テレビ観ても大丈夫だったりします？", "zh": "啊，是这样吗？那……\n要不，我们看电视也没关系？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1d391bd43a869d178142e4e7d8173b33d72f28abd9d940a6f9357873dbd4c8ea", "ja": "うーん、さすがにテレビは……どうかな？\n俺たちが向き合えないし、のんびりしすぎっていうか。", "zh": "嗯……电视还是算了吧……不太好说。\n毕竟我们没法面对面，而且感觉也太悠闲了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "c6b7bd6272eeb37fe2c1e0a9a710896d2f6c6b3f939867c7da7528a0eac32ae5", "ja": "やっぱり、そうですよね～。この時間だと、アイドルが\n出てる番組がいっぱいあるんですけど～。", "zh": "也是呢～这个时间段明明有好多\n偶像出演的节目呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1006_p", "source_sha256": "fe8751db6afa4821adedb57f60bd8e77d47ed92d208003c1c149756e2af681cd", "ja": "アイドル？　なるほど、それなら……。\nよし、いいぞ未来。テレビ、見てみよう。", "zh": "偶像？原来如此，那就……。\n好，没问题，未来。我们看看电视吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "dcd65b063eb9d8d6320d5c8e416ba3f39ac3073a3b36a572c53b5e2a8d565191", "ja": "いいんですか！？\nえへへ、ありがとうございますっ♪", "zh": "可以吗！？\n嘿嘿，谢谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1008_null", "source_sha256": "fab8835a5f8e3bdd4913bcb4e9a8ffa65e54a703681a2aec667ca24092cf0d0e", "ja": "ピッ", "zh": "嘀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "5d520d610501d1d35d25472630850f531ba4e1bd1e108d2cde14e8e671d9e5ab", "ja": "あ、やっぱり出てる！　わぁ……。見てください、\n{$P$}さん、この髪の長い子！", "zh": "啊，果然登出来了！哇……您看，{$P$}先生，这个长头发的孩子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "c61626d2303016a6c6d4e7d693fd80f022fa372026631a0ac8e30c74ad86b498", "ja": "ほら、可愛いですよね？\nたしか私と同い年じゃなかったかなー？", "zh": "您看，很可爱吧？\n我记得她是不是和我同岁来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "5ae72ebe660ff79d45260e8f484a238649f2e686f1a2c2e0b94df49e7cd33338", "ja": "歌もダンスも上手だし……わ、決めポーズカッコいい！\nいいな～、すごいな～。", "zh": "唱歌和跳舞都很棒……哇，定格姿势好帅！\n真好啊～好厉害啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "eb129ae134f5be0b27c37ff9f7f3004caf83ba2bf7bd111e1093e39eac26c497", "ja": "私も、いつかこんな風になれるのかな～？", "zh": "我也不知道自己什么时候才能变成这样呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d78f9de362db3d4ae3d22b4641c8822d5627a55b4c93e80956c6e925e257eade", "ja": "（テレビのアイドルを見つめる未来の目は、いつになく\n輝いている。自分の将来を重ね合わせているのか？）", "zh": "（未来凝视着电视里的偶像，眼中闪耀着前所未有的光芒。她是在憧憬自己的未来吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b4226a0f1824413f8ee47f642fe3d9095013efb8670f2908ca4f16f555b0b513", "ja": "（一応ライバルなんだけど……。焦りも嫉妬もなく、\n純粋にアイドルが好きなんだな。ある意味、大物だな）", "zh": "（姑且也算是竞争对手……。却没有焦躁，也没有嫉妒，是真的喜欢偶像啊。从某种意义上说，还真是个大人物）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "21bf0642a6020a9e82b3571796be14ed5e7d3ccce01ec48aaa9148af8632430e", "ja": "テレビ面白かったですね！　また一緒に観ましょうね、\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "电视节目很有意思呢！下次再一起看吧，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7f45a24f9229f253db16d59d589252c377338fa646e6d5518f3117a3bab347a5", "ja": "そうだな。それじゃ、そろそろ\n打ち合わせを再開しようか。", "zh": "是啊。那么，我们差不多该继续开会了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "08a20d789a77efd3e17a754d30db61c66c78d1b685a422c0028b569f79f3c03b", "ja": "打ち合わせ？　……あああああっ、忘れてました！！\n私、夢中になっちゃって……うう、ごめんなさーい……", "zh": "开会？　……啊啊啊啊啊，我给忘了！！\n我都聊得入迷了……呜呜，对不起——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1018_p", "source_sha256": "452f2d6c18914a22b59b91c1b2aade113fc5824c0c238f4bbe0374348cb42176", "ja": "はは、大丈夫だよ。それじゃあ改めて……。\nまずは、未来がやってみたい仕事ってあるかな？", "zh": "哈哈，没关系的。那我们重新开始……  \n首先，未来有没有想尝试的工作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "0819cf3e2529cae941da62af08edb0c5e0a932b2b21c120bd77f5abc93c068e0", "ja": "やってみたいお仕事？　うーん……。うーーーん……。\nうんっ、いろいろ全部やってみたいです！", "zh": "想尝试的工作？嗯……。唔——……  \n嗯！各种各样的工作，我全都想试试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1020_p", "source_sha256": "21fa21462851953d52e2ae70cd1602c76fc0f5cee1f7901b0dc2826a879ae973", "ja": "そ、そうか。意欲があるのは素晴らしいな！\nでも、もう少し絞ってみようか。え～っと……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。有干劲是好事！\n不过，还是再缩小一下范围吧。呃……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1021_p", "source_sha256": "56becef2e443b730cbb5a3484b1a2f41337b4ec7a1b1d67da0a1961018383db5", "ja": "仕事を種類別にまとめた資料があるから、見てみよう。\nほら、歌やダンス、お芝居、バラエティとあるだろ？", "zh": "我这里有一份按工作类型整理的资料，一起看看吧。\n你看，有唱歌、跳舞、演戏、综艺之类的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "2b616923d3147cf9f61daba9118e4d08d5307cee27571f7c15a0f8c29c10dec6", "ja": "わ、すごい。これ全部アイドルのお仕事ですか！？\nいっぱいだ……アイドルって何でもできるんですね～。", "zh": "哇，好厉害。这些全都是偶像的工作吗！？\n好多啊……偶像真是什么都能做呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1023_p", "source_sha256": "fd154f5a700c36ece0fd1a0201eac6a8243d0cc2ee9140a60750dae98d78425e", "ja": "もちろん、一人で全部できなくていいんだ。\nアイドルそれぞれで、色んな方向にいけるってこと。", "zh": "当然不用一个人全都做到。\n也就是说，每个偶像都可以朝不同的方向发展。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "d0d22ad42b4955f34ea283fbed78f0395c6a7837e8447f8d76553a149664ff3f", "ja": "そっか～。あ、静香ちゃんはコレがいいと思います！\n『カラオケ一発採点バトル！』！", "zh": "这样啊～。啊，我觉得静香应该选这个！\n《卡拉OK一发评分对决》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "ed069968c9686a5e4a96ecdf3eb3f6f4b05e69c04021c432471f3daabfee6127", "ja": "その『モテコーデ対決』は、翼にいいですよっ。\nぜったいやる気出すと思います♪", "zh": "那个“受欢迎穿搭对决”很适合翼哦。\n她肯定会打起精神来的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1026_p", "source_sha256": "aa9e0de7c9c0419686b221f17762140bcf1dbc246ceb2a17f5741b5a42abbdca", "ja": "へえ、よく見てるな……。じゃ、自分のことはどうだ？\nこの中で、未来が一番やってみたい仕事はどれだろう？", "zh": "哦，观察得还真仔细……那你自己呢？\n在这些工作中，未来最想尝试的是哪一个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "128147556bbf5c005d40c8b9fa661f56a3f70bf8911af6405bd2d769f58b4f76", "ja": "え、一番！？　ううう、難しいですよ～。\nこれかな～。でもでも、こっちもいいな～。", "zh": "诶，第一名！？呜呜呜，这很难选啊～  \n这个吧～不过不过，这个也不错呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "94db71fd47a5d5ceba77a7e718da2bb4b8ffb60a07f97c1217eada377e1f574e", "ja": "どのお仕事も楽しそう……。\n{$P$}さん、やっぱり全部です！", "zh": "每份工作看起来都很有趣……\n{$P$}先生，果然还是全部！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1029_p", "source_sha256": "89ff9714ce8065fe223be9f8dd0487745f34e8c0ce0508a345c7ca81d88feb79", "ja": "な、なるほど。でも、本当に全部は大変だけど……。\n未来はいつもそうなのか？　学校でも全教科好きとか？", "zh": "原、原来如此。不过，真的要全部都喜欢还是很辛苦的……\n未来一直都是这样吗？在学校里也是所有科目都喜欢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "9f8d86f462bdbe78b5a452dff3e9618372949cedac329a318625da495147ef37", "ja": "えっ、勉強ですか！？\nそれは～、そういう感じでも……。", "zh": "诶，学习吗！？\n这个嘛～，也不能说是那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1031_p", "source_sha256": "213781e95b837a587aef506efae3bd131f0cd05cadfc5d4f9d350d77f3f714a3", "ja": "（ないのか……）", "zh": "（没、没有吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "48662d3bd9a964d69f2a95bbe30f49aa85c124e0676e243558d34f9cbc6f2044", "ja": "あ、でも部活はそんな感じだったかも！\n楽しそうだな～って部活は、全部入っちゃいました♪", "zh": "啊，不过社团活动好像确实是那种感觉！\n凡是觉得“看起来好开心啊～”的社团，我全都参加了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "1deb31f5dcf73bbe4b38514aee707b42263869587da1a7b77e2a0b9eb6ed47b2", "ja": "どの部もみんな楽しそうだったし、私も日替わりで\nいろんな部活ができて、楽しかったです♪", "zh": "每个社团看起来都很有意思，我也能每天换着参加不同的社团，真的很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1034_p", "source_sha256": "98d3f6e51084fac590e87fcacc5889cb9446d7a8728246ee30c7977035cafa2a", "ja": "なるほど。もしかしたら、それが今の未来のあり方、\n……なのかもな。", "zh": "原来如此。或许，这就是现在未来的样子……\n……也说不定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1035_p", "source_sha256": "84dc2c9324b02175d25c41fc7e167ac74cfedf929acd99b2eb811200de64618f", "ja": "よし、わかった。それじゃ、今はとにかく\n楽しそうな仕事を片っ端からやってみよう！", "zh": "好，我明白了。那现在总之就把看起来有趣的工作一个不落地都试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "bb41bd0d2eafa878da3bead12625e8d2fc0c1346aff84e67ce4aae49669b42e3", "ja": "えっ？　いいんですかっ！？", "zh": "咦？真的可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_004_1037_p", "source_sha256": "af4b811cbac6f7c8374e537d71281d402fd7151b5ca85020ec534198c7bac1e7", "ja": "ああ。もちろん未来にできる範囲でだけど、\nやりたいことを我慢してもらう理由はなさそうだ。", "zh": "啊。当然，会在未来力所能及的范围内，\n没理由让她忍住不去做想做的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
